B.T7=s(["NICHD Assessment \u2013 6 categories with 9 clinical aspects in 4 domains (normal, mild, moderate, severe).","Evaluate all 9 aspects. Circle the worst domain for each of the categories. In both reflexes and autonomic, the worst domain dictates severity (e.g. for reflexes, weak suck, absent Moro would put neonate as severe in that category).","If two or more categories are not normal, (in any domain of HIE) then the neonate has at least mild HIE.","If three or more categories are moderate or severe, then neonate has moderate or severe HIE.","(e.g. 3 moderate, 2 severe, 1 mild = neonate would have moderate HIE).","If there are an equal number in mod/severe, then Category 1 (LoC) dictates grade.","Note if confirmed evidence of seizure activity, neonate classifies as at least moderate HIE."],t.s)
