B.ctT=new A.q_("Micropreemie","Micro-LBW","<750 g","Birthweight below 750 g \u2014 extreme end of the extremely-low birth weight spectrum.","Highest risk of mortality, IVH, NEC, BPD, ROP, and long-term neurodevelopmental impairment. Requires tertiary NICU care with surfactant, early CPAP/mechanical ventilation, and parenteral nutrition from Day 1.",B.mz,null,749)
B.ctX=new A.q_("Extremely Low Birth Weight","ELBW","<1000 g","Birthweight below 1000 g regardless of gestational age.","Very high risk of respiratory distress syndrome, IVH, NEC, sepsis, and PDA. Surfactant, early TPN, antenatal steroids, and strict fluid/glucose management required. Long-term neurodevelopmental follow-up mandatory.",B.a_,null,999)
